#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build, verify, activate, and roll back immutable preprocessor releases.

The builder copies an explicit source allowlist. Runtime state, packages, logs,
receipts, and private evidence are never copied. Release-contained LaunchAgent
templates are immutable source. Applied activation requires a verified external
drain receipt when replacing an active release, then performs a transactional
disable/bootout, plist installation, symlink switch and enable/bootstrap.
"""

